      "content": "Interesting. You mentioned the demographics in Eastside might exacerbate the outbreak. When looking at the spread in District 2 as well—the one with the South Asian and East African populations—how much of a factor are their specific cultural habits and lifestyle, like communal living or dietary traditions, compared to just the density/income stuff? Should we be looking at those cultural aspects as primary variables for the model?",
